"verificationPolicy": "Use official government, education-authority or authorised public information sources. Recheck study requirements, immigration rules, qualification recognition, costs and eligibility against current official sources before relying on them.",
"notes": [
"This is a country discovery list, not an endorsement, admission guarantee, visa guarantee or declaration that a qualification will be recognised in India.",
"Country codes use ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 conventions.",
"A studyInformationUrl is an information starting point and does not prove that a specific institution or programme is accredited or authorised to enrol international students.",
"Visa rules depend on nationality, course, institution, study duration and individual circumstances. Always check the responsible immigration authority.",
"For Indian students pursuing regulated professions such as medicine, verify applicable Indian regulator requirements and foreign institution or programme eligibility before making a decision.",
"Tuition, living costs, language requirements, scholarships, work rights and post-study options may change and must not be inferred from country inclusion.",
"Use null when an official student immigration URL has not been confidently established. Do not replace null with a guessed URL.",
"Check official website links before production publication and record the actual verification date when a link or claim is reviewed.",
"Country inclusion does not imply that every programme is available in English or that every qualification is accepted by another country’s regulator."
]
